 tests/by-util/test_pwd.rs         |  41 +++++---
 tests/by-util/test_readlink.rs    |  74 +++++++++------
 tests/by-util/test_realpath.rs    | 151 +++++++++++++++++-------------
 8 files changed, 191 insertions(+), 111 deletions(-)

